(text "Protected 1S cell only, 3.2-4.2 V useful range. No charger. Q1 reverse protection.\nBOOST_EN and CLK_EN have hardware pull-downs. TPS61099 has true shutdown disconnect.\nMCP1700 3.0 V always-on logic; 4.9/5.05 V boost only during prepared slots." (at 18 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3e9361a0-6aae-500f-a135-ed8be37d5ce9"))
